    "description": {
      "value": "A vision of apocalyptic destruction fills the mind of each creature in the area. The vision deals 11d6 mental damage (basic Will save). On a critical failure, the creature must also succeed at a Reflex save or believe it's trapped (stuck in a fissure, adrift at sea, or some other fate in keeping with its vision). If it fails the second save, it's also stunned for 1 minute. It can attempt a new Will save at the end of each of its turns, and on a success, it 2 and recovers from the stunned condition."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 2d6."
